          Can you tell me more about the latest trends in web development?
        </div>
        <div class="chat-message chat-message__bot">
          Sure thing! As of now, some of the popular trends in web development include using React for building user interfaces, implementing serverless architecture for scalable applications, and adopting a mobile-first approach for better user experience. Would you like me to provide more detailed information on any of these topics?
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

